{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/01/6884540/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブの時ね、\n扇風機で万理華さんと\n目が合うとこがあって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎回2人で変顔したり真顔したり\n遊んでたんだあ～(•    ω    •)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな中、アゴ出してくれた日が\nあったらしいんだけど\n気付かなかった(笑)(笑)(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/01/6884540/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんなさい＿|￣|○(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日、\nNHKBSプレミアムにて23:30より\n「乃木坂46SHOW」（AKB48SHOW「#48」）が放送されます✳︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の出番は、\nアンダー楽曲フルサイズ\nテレビ初披露♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"神宮球場でのライブを\n私と琴子でリポートします♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあ私は基本的にカメラマンなので\n琴子ワールド全開のリポートを\nお楽しみに(′ʘ⌄ʘ‵)♡(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/01/6884540/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/01/6884540/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"得意料理は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"得意料理はありません(′ʘ⌄ʘ‵)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく作るのは、\nカレー、シチュー、ハヤシライスww"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとはスパゲッティと\nときどきハンバーグ、餃子。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"簡単で一気に大量に\n作れるものばかり"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/01/6884540/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(笑)(笑)(笑)\nお菓子は得意！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/01/6884540/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"USJのハリーポッターのゼリービーンズ食べたことある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ない！今、ハリポタ最初から\n観直してて、\n食べてみたいなあってすごく\n思ってるんだけど、、、。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"味がこわい(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/01/6884540/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すき家だと、サイドメニュー(デザート類)が豊富だけど何が好きなの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デザートは頼まないなあ～。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すき家は3種のチーズ牛丼の中盛！\n吉野家は並のつゆだく！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"松屋となか卯は近所にない(๑´0`๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"専門学生のころは\n東京チカラめしによく行ってた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今季買った冬服、今のところ\nコート以外は全部\nGUとUNIQLO"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/01/6884540/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/01/6884540/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"か  り  ん  (っｴ`o)"}],"source":"archive"}